## Check the implementation

Test 320px width, keyboard scrolling, negative values, missing values, decimal alignment and a screen reader’s cell-header navigation. Do not hide important columns just to fit the viewport.

Use the [civica.uk accessibility checks](../accessibility/testing.html) and compare the rendered result in light and dark modes, Vivid and Muted tones, and at 320 CSS pixels. The example markup is a starting point; a theme alone does not add its application logic.

## Source and related guidance

[NHS table](https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/components/table) informs the component choice and interaction guidance. The examples use shared GOV.UK primitives or original civica.uk markup, Arial typography and civica.uk assets. NHS logos and service identity are not used.

